0..75 Comment "// A handler over a theory with laws is checked as a model of it: each law,"
76..153 Comment "// read through the handler\'s clauses, converts on both sides. A handler that"
154..231 Comment "// passes the state along is a model of every law of global state; a constant"
232..305 Comment "// one, answering every read alike and forgetting every store, is a model"
306..356 Comment "// only of the laws that repeat a read or a store."
358..422 Comment "// The theories `StatePutLaws`, `StateGetGet` and `StatePutPut`."
