449..522 Comment "/// The state passed along: the answer is a function of the state, a read"
523..597 Comment "/// applies what runs after it at the state, and a store applies it at the"
598..670 Comment "/// stored value. Both sides of put-get store and continue at the stored"
671..731 Comment "/// value, and both sides of put-put continue at the second."
